The recipe/ overlay and stage files and the vision-exp/port files are from
https://github.com/tonyd2wild/DeepSeek-v4-Flash-Vision-Exp-DSpark-1M-NVFP4-KV-2x-DGX-Spark
at commit 43201d1c2f281d238b8fd65f0f7168118f83169c (MIT, see LICENSE.upstream).
Overlay files are derived from vLLM (Apache-2.0). Base image:
ghcr.io/bjk110/vllm-spark (bjk110's DSpark-enabled vLLM runtime, Apache-2.0
labelled), pinned by digest.
